WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Build your own media system. Coordinate source, rights, versions, channels and reuse.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Start with one canonical source.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Carry rights into every derivative.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Track claims, versions and approvals.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Publish for each channel.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Reuse without losing the lineage.
